sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/morphoeval-delphi10000-dorudon-atrox-turing-wavelength-s0> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-dorudon-atrox-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> .
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-dorudon-atrox-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Dorudon atrox Turing wavelength at 253 µm, Priabonian 37.0 Ma (pass 1) — MorphoEval overall 76.3/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Pass 1 implements Schnakenberg kinetics with Du and Dv solved so lambda_c = 253 µm exactly (trace -0.330, det 1.002, Turing margin 704, sigma_max 0.093, equal-diffusion sigma_max -0.165). The pass-1 figure is the gallery plate, a linear J0 growth frame, and the nonlinear field. It does not yet show the diffusion-ratio sweep, the equal-diffusion field, or the plate radial overlay. Weighted overall 76.3. Overall 76.3/100 (faithfulness 73.6, reproducibility 82.8); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 0c76d15d14afcec6c366e1b9274a6586a0de48fc; environment: . Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 86, Morphological realism / specimen match 78, Parameter expressivity 52, Morphometric validation 64, Source and data traceability 86, Code-to-model traceability 80, Reproducibility package 82. Output judged: datasets/dorudon_atrox_turing_wavelength_s0/pass1_comparison.png: rendered output of models/2026-delphi10000-dorudon-atrox-turing-wavelength-s0.py at 0c76d15d14afcec6c366e1b9274a6586a0de48fc, image/png, 475631 B, 1344×456 px, artifact_sha256 30b37f843bdaf2bb6453594c74adac7d8a5ca95d78a714414ab17426255800eb (sha256 30b37f843bdaf2bb6453594c74adac7d8a5ca95d78a714414ab17426255800eb), spec_fingerprint 46aab34eb8903a5c5e8fe581a0d8a160edfd47f81ba888aafd43c512c489faac. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 46aab34eb8903a5c5e8fe581a0d8a160edfd47f81ba888aafd43c512c489faac; artifact_sha256: 30b37f843bdaf2bb6453594c74adac7d8a5ca95d78a714414ab17426255800eb; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/dorudon_atrox_turing_wavelength_s0/dorudon_atrox_turing_wavelength_s0_reference.json=df3cab3ac71f7f45..., datasets/dorudon_atrox_turing_wavelength_s0/dorudon_atrox_turing_wavelength_s0_specimen.jpg=5a04e317b788950e..., datasets/dorudon_atrox_turing_wavelength_s0/dorudon_atrox_wadi_el_hitan.jpg=fdadd7e651f209ef...}. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Turing 1952 critical wavenumber and the requirement that the inhibitor diffuse farther than the activator | Murray 1981 coat pre-pattern hypothesis | Dorudon atrox is a Priabonian basilosaurid with a vestigial hindlimb; reconstructed_in_script: a=0.164, b=0.837, Dv/Du=15.970 so that lambda_c = 253 µm | Hindlimb domain scenario of 8, 3, and 0 critical wavelengths; transfer_boundary: Pigment Turing patterns from fish and a theoretical coat model are transferred to an animal with no preserved skin; does_not_claim: That Dorudon skin bore this ocellus | That the 8/3/0 counts are measured embryonic bud lengths." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Fit the plate azimuthal luminance at k corresponding to 253 µm and report Pearson r, RMSE, and KS, with the polynomial-only fit as the baseline.",
            "remediation needed: Hold Du fixed and sweep Dv/Du across the critical ratio; show lambda and sigma_max moving, including a ratio that is stable.",
            "remediation needed: Put the 8 → 3 → 0 hindlimb mode counts on the comparison figure.",
            "remediation needed: Re-score specimen match against both the pattern plate and the Wadi El-Hitan fossil after that figure exists.",
            "remediation needed: Render the equal-diffusion integration beside the slot run so the ablation is a field, not only a signed growth rate." ;
        pk:hasScore "0.763"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "mostly faithful" .
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Grok 4.7 (builder and assessor, single-agent cloud loop; no second assessor)" ;
        dct:identifier "grok-4.7" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf <https://orcid.org/0009-0007-4948-9192> .
}

